&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About RELEX:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;RELEX Solutions create cutting-edge supply chain and retail planning software. Within our platforms, we have the power and potential to increase adaptability, efficiency, and sustainability in the consumer goods and retail value chain. Our impact is tangible; from sustainability and eliminating waste to delighting customers and delivering great tailored tech solutions, we’re curious and passionate challenge-seekers creating the future of retail today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re currently a global team of 2000+ employees working from offices in the US (Atlanta), UK, Germany, Sweden, Norway, Denmark, France, Italy, Spain, Portugal, Singapore, Australia, and our headquarters in Helsinki, Finland. We work in small teams where everyone’s input is valued. We’re passionate about what we do, we like putting our skills to the test, and we make sure we have fun during the process — because life is supposed to be fun.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RELEX Solutions is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced (Senior) Marketing Manager to take ownership of various field marketing projects across Europe and with a specific focus on the DACH region. In this role, you will be responsible for executing strategic marketing initiatives that drive demand generation, strengthen partnerships, and accelerate sales opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with the Field Marketing, Sales, Business Development, and Customer Success teams to develop and implement localized marketing strategies that align with our key industry verticals and buyer personas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to shape and execute key components of our EMEA go-to-market strategy, including trade shows, customer activations, executive events, and digital campaigns. If you are a strategic thinker with hands-on marketing expertise, a deep understanding of B2B enterprise sales cycles, and experience engaging senior decision-makers in retail, wholesale, and manufacturing industries, this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Event &amp;amp; Field Marketing Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute integrated event marketing programs that align with business objectives, including in-person trade shows, conferences, association activations, executive briefings, and virtual experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the event calendar and execution of regional events, including contract negotiations, vendor management, site selection, registration, agenda planning, staffing, on-site production, signage, and content development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage custom events that engage both customers and prospects, driving lead generation and strategic account engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing and promotional strategies around RELEX Live events across EMEA, ensuring alignment with pipeline goals and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop co-marketing initiatives with partners, media, and associations with joint value propositions incl. events, webinars, campaigns, and content syndication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate industry events to determine sponsorship and engagement opportunities aligned with RELEX’s target verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop promotional and engagement strategies to ensure event participation from the right audience at the right time, driving SQLs and qualified meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our solution experts, ABM, Global Campaigns, and Brand &amp;amp; Creative teams to develop high-impact content and assets (landing pages, videos, handouts, digital ads, social banners, etc.) tailored to our target sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute pre-, during-, and post-event campaigns that maximize attendance, brand awareness, and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and measure event impact on pipeline, marketing-influenced revenue, and sales acceleration to refine future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct pre- and post-event analysis to evaluate success metrics, optimize lead qualification processes, and ensure strong alignment with sales follow-up strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data-driven insights to inform marketing decisions and improve ROI on event investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B field and event marketing, preferably in technology, supply chain software, or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing both in-person and digital events as part of an integrated marketing strategy that supports pipeline acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with sales and business development teams to align marketing initiatives with revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the B2B sales funnel, pipeline management, and the role field marketing plays in lead conversion and acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and prioritization skills, with the ability to manage multiple programs and stakeholders simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with experience developing marketing content for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A results-driven, self-motivated mindset with a passion for creating measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sense of ownership, accountability, and a desire to contribute to RELEX’s growth in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably experience within the Manufacturing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are a global community of different cultures, voices, and experiences. We celebrate what makes us unique and connect through what we share, in an authentic and safe environment. Together we shape the future, and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;If you feel this is the opportunity you don’t want to miss, you can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible. If you have questions, Noemi ----- from our Talent Acquisition team is happy to answer them by email. Please note that we cannot process any applications through email.   &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Apply today and be part of the future. Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍Remote UK | 💰£40,400 - £51,050 (12 Month Fixed Term Contract) &amp;nbsp;+&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;⭐ &lt;strong&gt;Our Workforce Management (WFM) team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity to step into a key Senior Service Analyst role on a 12-month fixed-term contract. You&#39;ll report to the WFM Service Manager and play a vital role in using data-driven insights to perfectly staff our customer operations and service teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a strong individual contributor, taking ownership of problems and leading on the design and implementation of solutions from start to finish. We are looking for someone with strong data skills to perform in-depth analysis, automate processes, and create independent Management Information (MI) and dashboards to support operations. You will help us comfortably navigate challenging trade-offs to achieve our goals while giving our customers the best experience possible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔑 &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You will compile data-driven reports that provide key insights and actions for senior stakeholders, including weekly reporting, Monthly Business Reviews (MBRs), Ops Monitoring, and Domain Weekly Business Reviews (WBRs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Pipeline &amp;amp; Dashboard Creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently creating fully functional Looker dashboards and developing standalone MI to support the operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-depth Analysis &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Performing confident root-cause analysis by filtering, merging, and amending complex data across Looker, Anaplan, Airtable, and Google Sheets. You will write efficient SQL code and facilitate automation wherever possible to improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Burndown Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Creating dynamic burndown plans to accurately predict return-to-service dates and forecast when service situations will be fully resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Management &amp;amp; Rota:&lt;/strong&gt; Taking responsibility for managing cross-domain incidents using data-driven and dynamic solutions. You will be on call for incidents as part of a Monday to Friday rota. You may occasionally be asked to work a weekend to support very specific projects, but this is not part of your standard working pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Deep Dives &amp;amp; Routing:&lt;/strong&gt; Conducting deep dives to identify gaps between supply and demand, managing task views and routing, and ensuring the right work goes to the right person at the right time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Ops Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Working closely with our global ops functions to ensure performance expectations are met and assessing the service impact of proposed changes across various domains.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤩 &lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrable experience in service delivery, optimisation, and workforce management within a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly capable of managing a project&#39;s entire lifecycle with little oversight, taking accountability for driving solutions and leading implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess an advanced ability to use Looker and Google Sheets for deep data storytelling and presenting clear findings via Google Slides and Documentsx.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience handling incidents, creating actionable plans, and thinking of dynamic, data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with critical conversations, communicating effectively to a wide range of stakeholders, and coaching those around you to elevate team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a great understanding of task views, task types, routing, scheduled activities, and workforce optimisation principles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything that&#39;s listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🙌 &lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰£40,400 - £51,050 (12-Month Fixed Term Contract).&lt;br&gt;📍This role can be based remotely anywhere in the UK, or our London or Cardiff office.&lt;br&gt;⏰ You will be on call for incidents as part of a Monday to Friday rota. You may occasionally be asked to work a weekend to support very specific projects, but this is not part of your standard working pattern.&lt;br&gt;🏡We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given MacBooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&lt;br&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;br&gt;➕ Plus lots more! Read our full list of&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers&quot;&gt; benefits.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview (Role-specific and values combined) and Present Back Task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 4 weeks but we&#39;ll always work around your availability. You&#39;ll have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during your process, but if you do have any specific questions ahead of this please contact &lt;a ---------- We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. You can read them&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing date for this role is the 28th of August 2026.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-REMOTE #LI-DR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
