&lt;p&gt;This role is part of our eBay Inhouse team, where you will be employed by DEPT® but embedded within eBay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At eBay, what happens in culture is often reflected in what people are buying and selling. As a cultural barometer, we have a unique opportunity to use social media to connect with communities in relevant, authentic and meaningful ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a culture-obsessed Social Community Manager to help make eBay a brand people want to engage with, talk about and champion. You&#39;ll combine best-in-class community management with proactive social storytelling, ensuring eBay has an active, engaging presence across our organic social channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for managing day-to-day community engagement, publishing content, identifying reactive opportunities, monitoring social conversations and creating platform-native content that keeps eBay relevant within culture. Working closely with Social, PR, Customer Service and agency partners, you&#39;ll turn social insights into meaningful engagement whilst protecting and evolving the eBay brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is customer-obsessed, culturally curious, an exceptional copywriter and thrives in a fast-paced social environment where trends move quickly and opportunities appear every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of eBay across our organic social channels—present, authentic and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor conversations, mentions and audience sentiment across social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write timely, engaging responses that build relationships and foster community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with creators, sellers, communities and relevant third parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to spark conversation and increase community participation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule/Publish approved organic content across eBay UK and eBay Live UK social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reactive social content in response to cultural moments, PR activity, breaking news and trending conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track emerging trends, audience conversations and community sentiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify reactive opportunities, creator partnerships and user-generated content opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring social trends, platform updates and cultural insights into regular team planning and newsroom sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce regular community and sentiment reporting with actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moderate community conversations in line with agreed guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove spam, bot activity and harmful content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate reputational risks, sensitive conversations and customer issues where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain eBay&#39;s tone of voice and brand standards across every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Social, PR, Customer Service and agency partners to ensure consistent messaging and appropriate escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with internal stakeholders to identify opportunities for social-first storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas that improve creative development, community engagement and social performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing social communities for a major brand or agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience across Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, Pinterest, Reddit and emerging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional copywriting skills and the ability to adapt tone of voice across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating platform-native social content, particularly in TikTok.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of internet culture, trends, memes, creators and online communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using social publishing, listening and community management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgement when managing sensitive conversations and protecting brand reputation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate community conversations into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation with the ability to manage multiple priorities and respond quickly to emerging opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset with a proactive, creative approach to problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for social media, culture and creating engaging customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
