&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re bold thinkers and kind teammates, growing fast but staying grounded. Our Nordic roots and global outlook shape a culture of friendliness, creativity, and collaboration, all powered by openness and shared wins. We care deeply about doing the right thing – and doing it together. We aim to improve the flow of goods, time, and energy – and we know we can’t shape the future by clinging to the past. So, we keep evolving, together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;RELEX&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solutions delivers a unified supply chain planning platform for retailers and manufacturers, enabled by proven AI technology. We help companies optimize demand forecasting, replenishment, merchandising, pricing and promotions, supply chain operations, and production planning across the end-to-end value chain. With a global team of over 2,000 professionals, we work side-by-side with our customers to solve real problems with lasting impact. Companies trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;RELEX&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;to increase product availability, boost sales, deliver actionable insights, improve sustainability, and drive profitable growth. Join us and make an impact on the world and your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW58308941 BCX0&quot;&gt;Are you an experienced Workday professional with a passion for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW58308941 BCX0&quot;&gt;optimizing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW58308941 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;HR technology and a genuine interest in high-growth companies? Are you excited at the prospect of shaping how a global organization gets the most out of Workday? If this sounds like you, then&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW58308941 BCX0&quot;&gt;we’d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW58308941 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;love to chat!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Following the successful implementation and go-live of Workday,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for an experienced Senior People Tech Specialist to join our People Tech team and help shape the next chapter of our Workday journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The People team at RELEX currently consists of 50+ professionals located in different countries globally, with the majority in Helsinki. As we continue to grow, we want to ensure we serve our RELEXians to the best possible level – and getting the most out of Workday is central to that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In this role, you will help us optimize and develop our Workday platform while supporting a global organization operating across 20 countries. You will work closely with People Operations, IT, business stakeholders and external partners to ensure Workday continues to support our growth and employee experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys both hands-on system work and solving broader HR technology challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Configure,&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;and continuously improve Workday functionality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex Workday issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Assess the impact of changes across Workday modules, business&amp;nbsp;processes&amp;nbsp;and security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Support HR process development and&amp;nbsp;e.g.&amp;nbsp;organizational changes&amp;nbsp;or other key processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create and improve reports and dashboards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with AMS providers and internal stakeholders to deliver scalable solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Act as a senior Workday subject matter expert and technical sparring partner within the People Tech team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Contribute to prioritizing and driving enhancement initiatives from idea to implementation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for someone who combines strong Workday&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;with curiosity and a pragmatic mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on Workday experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience supporting and developing Workday in a mature, post-go-live environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with Core HCM and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;few other key modules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The ability to quickly understand how changes impact different modules, business&amp;nbsp;processes&amp;nbsp;and security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and stakeholder management skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently and take ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to work with&amp;nbsp;highly sensitive&amp;nbsp;and confidential information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail, with the ability to manage multiple high-visibility projects simultaneously&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills, with full working fluency in English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A can-do attitude combined with networking skills,&amp;nbsp;assertiveness&amp;nbsp;and the willingness to take initiative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Talent, Peakon,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting, Absence Management, Time&amp;nbsp;Tracking&amp;nbsp;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;/or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Workday Security is considered a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why RELEX?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to join&amp;nbsp;immediately&amp;nbsp;after a successful global Workday implementation and help shape how the platform evolves over the coming years.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;join a collaborative People Tech team where&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;have the opportunity to influence both day-to-day operations and longer-term improvements, working closely with colleagues across People,&amp;nbsp;IT&amp;nbsp;and the wider business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving problems, improving&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;and making a real impact on how people experience HR technology,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we offer you in return:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A&amp;nbsp;unique chance to join a&amp;nbsp;fast-growin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;g&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;company and a professional people team where you have ownership of your own working area and are able to develop processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;An&amp;nbsp;international career&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and learning opportunities&amp;nbsp;with an employer&amp;nbsp;who’s&amp;nbsp;genuinely&amp;nbsp;keen on supporting your growth&amp;nbsp;and the use of AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A fun, ambitious and committed team of smart people to work with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours, freedom in organizing your own work and possibility to work remotely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Other add-on benefits&amp;nbsp;like&amp;nbsp;mobile, sport &amp;amp; culture,&amp;nbsp;bike,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;ergonomic equipment to&amp;nbsp;your home office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A position where you can help retailers fight against food waste&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you the one we’re looking for?&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible, but no later than 30&lt;span data-fontsize=&quot;11&quot;&gt;th&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;of August 2026.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our team is looking forward&amp;nbsp;to having&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;great&amp;nbsp;add to the team, so&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;apply now! This opportunity and a chance to join a wonderful group of professionals and an exciting international environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that we cannot process any applications through email.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About RELEX:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;RELEX Solutions create cutting-edge supply chain and retail planning software. Within our platforms, we have the power and potential to increase adaptability, efficiency, and sustainability in the consumer goods and retail value chain. Our impact is tangible; from sustainability and eliminating waste to delighting customers and delivering great tailored tech solutions, we’re curious and passionate challenge-seekers creating the future of retail today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re currently a global team of 2000+ employees working from offices in the US (Atlanta), UK, Germany, Sweden, Norway, Denmark, France, Italy, Spain, Portugal, Singapore, Australia, and our headquarters in Helsinki, Finland. We work in small teams where everyone’s input is valued. We’re passionate about what we do, we like putting our skills to the test, and we make sure we have fun during the process — because life is supposed to be fun.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RELEX Solutions is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced (Senior) Marketing Manager to take ownership of various field marketing projects across Europe and with a specific focus on the DACH region. In this role, you will be responsible for executing strategic marketing initiatives that drive demand generation, strengthen partnerships, and accelerate sales opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with the Field Marketing, Sales, Business Development, and Customer Success teams to develop and implement localized marketing strategies that align with our key industry verticals and buyer personas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to shape and execute key components of our EMEA go-to-market strategy, including trade shows, customer activations, executive events, and digital campaigns. If you are a strategic thinker with hands-on marketing expertise, a deep understanding of B2B enterprise sales cycles, and experience engaging senior decision-makers in retail, wholesale, and manufacturing industries, this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Event &amp;amp; Field Marketing Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute integrated event marketing programs that align with business objectives, including in-person trade shows, conferences, association activations, executive briefings, and virtual experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the event calendar and execution of regional events, including contract negotiations, vendor management, site selection, registration, agenda planning, staffing, on-site production, signage, and content development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage custom events that engage both customers and prospects, driving lead generation and strategic account engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing and promotional strategies around RELEX Live events across EMEA, ensuring alignment with pipeline goals and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop co-marketing initiatives with partners, media, and associations with joint value propositions incl. events, webinars, campaigns, and content syndication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate industry events to determine sponsorship and engagement opportunities aligned with RELEX’s target verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop promotional and engagement strategies to ensure event participation from the right audience at the right time, driving SQLs and qualified meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our solution experts, ABM, Global Campaigns, and Brand &amp;amp; Creative teams to develop high-impact content and assets (landing pages, videos, handouts, digital ads, social banners, etc.) tailored to our target sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute pre-, during-, and post-event campaigns that maximize attendance, brand awareness, and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and measure event impact on pipeline, marketing-influenced revenue, and sales acceleration to refine future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct pre- and post-event analysis to evaluate success metrics, optimize lead qualification processes, and ensure strong alignment with sales follow-up strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data-driven insights to inform marketing decisions and improve ROI on event investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B field and event marketing, preferably in technology, supply chain software, or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing both in-person and digital events as part of an integrated marketing strategy that supports pipeline acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with sales and business development teams to align marketing initiatives with revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the B2B sales funnel, pipeline management, and the role field marketing plays in lead conversion and acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and prioritization skills, with the ability to manage multiple programs and stakeholders simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with experience developing marketing content for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A results-driven, self-motivated mindset with a passion for creating measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sense of ownership, accountability, and a desire to contribute to RELEX’s growth in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably experience within the Manufacturing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are a global community of different cultures, voices, and experiences. We celebrate what makes us unique and connect through what we share, in an authentic and safe environment. Together we shape the future, and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;If you feel this is the opportunity you don’t want to miss, you can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible. If you have questions, Noemi ----- from our Talent Acquisition team is happy to answer them by email. Please note that we cannot process any applications through email.   &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Apply today and be part of the future. Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Product Manager, Prolific For Research ( UK Remote)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;(6 Month Fixed Term Contract or Contractor Engagement)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Team: Product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditised, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prolific for Research helps researchers reach the right participants for their study and run more sophisticated, higher-value research. That includes work on helping researchers find exactly who they need for a study, and on supporting research studies that are more complex in scope or duration than a single one-off survey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to take ownership of the next phase of the Research roadmap, scaling what&#39;s already shipped, growing adoption, and iterating based on researcher feedback. The nature of the projects/work that this role will cover, means that the role can be offered as either a fixed-term employee or contractor&amp;nbsp; basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll own the outcomes of a small, stream-aligned team within our Research Group. Online research is changing fast amid AI-tools that are re-shaping the playing field and raising the expectations and challenges of providing trustworthy samples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring a track record of shipping and scaling products that simplify complex workflows for demanding professional or enterprise users, and know how to use data and user behaviour to inform decisions. Experience building for researchers or research tools is a plus, but we&#39;re just as interested in strong product fundamentals from elsewhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain: &lt;/strong&gt;This is core to Prolific&#39;s 2026 strategy, and to how we deepen our value for research customers ranging from individual academics to institutional and enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll product manage a small team of engineers, hands-on with discovery and delivery, and accountable for delivering key outcomes. You&#39;ll work closely with fellow Product Managers across Research and AI, the VP of Research, and collaborators across human data operations, integrity, support, science, sales, and client services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Adding on to our Prolific Principles, we expect colleagues in the Product, Research, and Design Group to demonstrate reliability, grit, diplomacy, a bias for action, and a dogged focus on value – you&#39;ll be a champion of these behaviours yourself, and in the culture of your team. Accountability and autonomy are two sides of the same coin, and we expect you to demonstrate both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help researchers find exactly the participants they need for a study, beyond broad demographic targeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow adoption of more ambitious study designs, such as research that runs longer or asks more of participants than a single one-off survey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the supporting tools that make these more advanced study types easier to run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the day-to-day product lifecycle for your areas: prioritisation, delivery, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an unblocker and simplifier of complexity: colleagues will bring you problems, and emerge optimistic, with solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering and Design as a tight product trio, in a test-learn-iterate fashion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working embedded in technology teams alongside engineers and designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mindset and experience with AI tools and workflows for PMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping for demanding professional or enterprise users, research, survey, or data-collection tools, or complex B2B workflows, are all relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in modern Product/Engineering practice: Agile, continuous discovery and delivery, JTBD, vertical slicing, test-learn-iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and data-informed decision-making, paired with a storyteller&#39;s flair and a relentless can-do attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for the academic or research sector, or with expert networks, panels, or credentialing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioral data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviors into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
